---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: "Get in touch with Dad Knows Dungeons — questions, campaign pitches, or podcast feedback welcome."
permalink: /contact/
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede mb-lg">Questions about a campaign, feedback on an episode, or a GM problem you want us to cover on the show — send it over.</p>

    <form class="stack" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
      <p class="visually-hidden">
        <label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field"></label>
      </p>

      <div class="field">
        <label class="field__label" for="contact-name">Name</label>
        <input class="field__input" id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" required>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label class="field__label" for="contact-email">Email</label>
        <input class="field__input" id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" required>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label class="field__label" for="contact-message">Message</label>
        <textarea class="field__textarea" id="contact-message" name="message" required></textarea>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
      <p class="form-note">This form is handled by Netlify Forms — no backend required. Submissions land in your Netlify dashboard under Forms.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Find us elsewhere</h2>
    <ul class="footer__list" style="color: inherit;">
      <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.social.email }}">{{ site.social.email }}</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}">Instagram</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}">YouTube</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <div class="stack">
      <div>
        <h3>Do you take campaign or episode-topic suggestions?</h3>
        <p>Always. Use the form above or email us directly — GM-advice topics from listeners are some of our favorite episodes to record.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Can I be a guest on the show?</h3>
        <p>Reach out with a bit about what you'd want to talk about. We're especially interested in GMs running systems we haven't covered yet.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>How do I get a transcript for an episode?</h3>
        <p>Transcripts are on the way for every episode — check the episode page, and if you need one sooner, just ask.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
